# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Changes to `generate_preset_pass_manager` interface {#changes-to-generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"
msgstr "Änderungen an der `generate_preset_pass_manager`-Schnittstelle {#changes-to-generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 includes a series of updates to the preset pass manager interface (that is, the\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) and\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) functions) that affect the\n"
"handling of loose constraint inputs, such as `coupling_map` or `basis_gates`. The number of\n"
"transpilation use cases where loose constraints are accepted has been reduced in favor of the\n"
"`target` and `backend` inputs (where `backend` is a [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) that\n"
"contains a [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"which allow for a more expressive communication of these constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 enthält eine Reihe von Aktualisierungen der Preset-Pass-Manager-Schnittstelle (d. h. der Funktionen\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) und\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile)), die sich auf die\n"
"Behandlung loser Constraint-Eingaben wie `coupling_map` oder `basis_gates` auswirken. Die Anzahl der\n"
"Transpilations-Anwendungsfälle, bei denen lose Constraints akzeptiert werden, wurde zugunsten der\n"
"Eingaben `target` und `backend` reduziert (wobei `backend` ein [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) ist, das\n"
"eine [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)-Instanz enthält),\n"
"die eine ausdrucksstärkere Kommunikation dieser Constraints ermöglichen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples show the main changes and suggested alternatives for migrating. Note that all\n"
"of the migration tips below apply to both `transpile` and `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Die folgenden Beispiele zeigen die wichtigsten Änderungen und empfohlene Alternativen für die Migration. Beachte, dass alle\n"
"nachfolgenden Migrationstipps sowohl für `transpile` als auch für `generate_preset_pass_manager` gelten:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend_properties` input argument is no longer supported, and the `BackendProperties` class has\n"
"been removed. You should use the `target` or `backend` arguments instead to communicate\n"
"gate durations and errors. There are multiple paths for constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"
msgstr ""
"Das Eingabeargument `backend_properties` wird nicht mehr unterstützt, und die Klasse `BackendProperties` wurde\n"
"entfernt. Verwende stattdessen die Argumente `target` oder `backend`, um Gate-Dauern und Fehlerraten zu übermitteln.\n"
"Es gibt mehrere Möglichkeiten, ein benutzerdefiniertes [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) zu erstellen:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  a. Build a target from scratch and add the relevant errors and durations to the corresponding gates:\n"
msgstr "  a. Erstelle ein Target von Grund auf und füge die relevanten Fehler und Dauern zu den entsprechenden Gates hinzu:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"
msgstr "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  b. Use [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) to quickly build a\n"
"     generic target with pre-filled errors and durations. These can also be updated post-construction:\n"
msgstr ""
"  b. Verwende [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2), um schnell ein\n"
"     generisches Target mit vorausgefüllten Fehlern und Dauern zu erstellen. Diese können auch nach der Erstellung aktualisiert werden:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. The `instruction_durations` and `timing_constraints` input arguments are no longer supported. You should use the\n"
"  `target` or `backend` arguments instead. The alternatives are constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) from\n"
"  scratch, constructing a generic backend, and, in addition to these, it is possible to build a custom target with\n"
"  `instruction_durations` and/or `timing_constraints` using the `Target.from_configuration` method:\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Die Eingabeargumente `instruction_durations` und `timing_constraints` werden nicht mehr unterstützt. Verwende\n"
"  stattdessen die Argumente `target` oder `backend`. Die Alternativen sind: ein benutzerdefiniertes [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) von\n"
"  Grund auf erstellen, ein generisches Backend erstellen, und – zusätzlich dazu – ist es möglich, ein benutzerdefiniertes Target mit\n"
"  `instruction_durations` und/oder `timing_constraints` über die Methode `Target.from_configuration` zu erstellen:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"
msgstr ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"
msgstr ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Providing `coupling_map` and/or `basis_gates` along with a `backend` is discouraged, and from\n"
"  v2.0 a `UserWarning` will be raised. In these cases there are multiple sources of truth,\n"
"  and information such as gate errors and durations from the backend cannot be resolved based on the\n"
"  information given.\n"
"  The suggested alternative is to define a custom target that combines the chosen constraints either\n"
"  from scratch, using [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) or [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"3. Die Kombination aus `coupling_map` und/oder `basis_gates` zusammen mit einem `backend` wird nicht empfohlen, und\n"
"  ab v2.0 wird eine `UserWarning` ausgegeben. In diesen Fällen gibt es mehrere Quellen der Wahrheit,\n"
"  und Informationen wie Gate-Fehler und -Dauern aus dem Backend können anhand der gegebenen Informationen nicht aufgelöst werden.\n"
"  Die empfohlene Alternative ist die Definition eines benutzerdefinierten Targets, das die gewählten Constraints entweder\n"
"  von Grund auf, über [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) oder [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) kombiniert.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. The `basis_gates` argument no longer accepts custom basis gates. The suggested alternative\n"
"  is the `target` argument, which can be built from scratch or through [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  such as:\n"
msgstr ""
"4. Das Argument `basis_gates` akzeptiert keine benutzerdefinierten Basis-Gates mehr. Die empfohlene Alternative\n"
"  ist das Argument `target`, das von Grund auf oder über [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) erstellt werden kann,\n"
"  zum Beispiel:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. The input combination where a custom `coupling_map` is provided with either a `backend` or `basis_gates`\n"
"  that contain gates with three or more qubits is no longer allowed. The coupling map\n"
"  does not provide the necessary connectivity details to be able to determine the  action of the gate.\n"
"  In these cases, the recommended migration path is the creation of a custom target from scratch.\n"
msgstr ""
"5. Die Eingabe-Kombination, bei der eine benutzerdefinierte `coupling_map` zusammen mit einem `backend` oder `basis_gates`\n"
"  angegeben wird, die Gates mit drei oder mehr Qubits enthalten, ist nicht mehr erlaubt. Die Coupling Map\n"
"  liefert nicht die notwendigen Konnektivitätsdetails, um die Wirkung des Gates bestimmen zu können.\n"
"  In diesen Fällen ist der empfohlene Migrationspfad die Erstellung eines benutzerdefinierten Targets von Grund auf.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. The `inst_map` argument has been removed without alternative. It was used to provide pulse information\n"
"  to the transpiler, and the full `qiskit.pulse` module has been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"6. Das Argument `inst_map` wurde ohne Alternative entfernt. Es diente dazu, dem Transpiler Pulse-Informationen\n"
"  bereitzustellen, und das vollständige Modul `qiskit.pulse` wurde entfernt.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"
msgstr "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The module `qiskit.pulse` has been completely removed from Qiskit, without replacement.\n"
"This includes the related items:\n"
msgstr ""
"Das Modul `qiskit.pulse` wurde vollständig aus Qiskit entfernt, ohne Ersatz.\n"
"Dazu gehören die folgenden verwandten Elemente:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) and [`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency) property `calibrations`.\n"
msgstr "die Eigenschaft `calibrations` von [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) und [`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) methods `has_calibration_for` and `add_calibration`.\n"
msgstr "die Methoden `has_calibration_for` und `add_calibration` von [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) method `has_calibration_for`.\n"
msgstr "die Methode `has_calibration_for` von [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the transpiler passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, `RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"
msgstr "die Transpiler-Passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, `RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the module `qiskit.scheduler` and all its contents.\n"
msgstr "das Modul `qiskit.scheduler` und alle seine Inhalte.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) methods `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, `acquire_channel` and `control_channel`.\n"
msgstr "die Methoden `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, `acquire_channel` und `control_channel` von [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) methods `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` and `update_from_instruction_schedule_map`.\n"
msgstr "die Methoden `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` und `update_from_instruction_schedule_map` von [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the `inst_map` argument of [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile), and [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"
msgstr "das Argument `inst_map` von [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) und [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the `calibration` field of [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"
msgstr "das Feld `calibration` von [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This happened because IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs ceased to offer pulse-level access, and the Qiskit team no longer had resources to maintain the little-used package.\n"
"You can continue to use the `qiskit.pulse` module while using the v1.x series of Qiskit, which has bug-fix support until September 2024 and security support until March 2025, but the module is removed from the v2.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dies geschah, weil IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs keinen Pulse-Level-Zugriff mehr anbieten und dem Qiskit-Team keine Ressourcen mehr zur Verfügung standen, um das wenig genutzte Paket zu pflegen.\n"
"Du kannst das Modul `qiskit.pulse` weiterhin verwenden, solange du die v1.x-Serie von Qiskit nutzt, die Bugfix-Support bis September 2024 und Sicherheitssupport bis März 2025 hat, aber das Modul wurde aus der v2.x-Serie entfernt.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most uses of `qiskit.pulse` can be replaced with direct access to fractional gates on IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (and later generations, if applicable).\n"
"You can read more in [the migration guide for converted pulse usage to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Die meisten Verwendungen von `qiskit.pulse` können durch direkten Zugriff auf fraktionale Gates auf IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (und späteren Generationen, falls zutreffend) ersetzt werden.\n"
"Mehr dazu erfährst du im [Migrationsleitfaden für die Umstellung von Pulse-Nutzung auf fraktionale Gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can no longer load QPY files that contain `ScheduleBlock` objects in Qiskit v2.0 because of the removal of Qiskit Pulse.\n"
"You can continue to load these files in the Qiskit v1.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst keine QPY-Dateien mehr laden, die `ScheduleBlock`-Objekte enthalten, da Qiskit Pulse in Qiskit v2.0 entfernt wurde.\n"
"Du kannst diese Dateien weiterhin in der Qiskit v1.x-Serie laden.\n"
